  "moreAboutByGenre": {
   "Kanjeevaram": "<ul class=\"metafield-single_line_text_field-array\"><li class=\"metafield-single_line_text_field\">Kanjeevaram silk saree is a magnificent creation of the craftsmen living in a small town, Kanchi (Kanchipuram), situated near the Chennai city of South India.The motifs used in an Indian Kanchipuram sari are heavily based on the Pallava temples, palaces and paintings, and are made in fine silk. The sheer magnitude of textures, colors and designs is astounding. it is said that the actress Rekha once caused a traffic jam in the streets of Paris, the fashion capital of the world, when she stepped out wearing a gold kanjeevaram saree!</li></ul>"
  }
